  "question": {
    "text": "In the given arrangement, the rod is free to rotate about the hinge and it is in constant contact with the equilateral triangular block of base length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>. If the block is moving horizontally with a speed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>ms</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then&nbsp;find the magnitude of the angular velocity of the rod (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>rad</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>) at the instant when <math><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> [Given that <math> <mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></math>]<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0070_937f863c4276.jpeg\" style=\"width: 321px; height: 273px;\" />"
  },
